{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802500/extras/3e8621cefd162ef668ff4b0ce2e23adb.poster.avif?t=1764682048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802500/extras/3e8621cefd162ef668ff4b0ce2e23adb.webm?t=1764682048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect and upgrade your EYES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each eye alters bounces, damage and abilities, creating ever-new (and ever-questionable) builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802500/extras/a95ccec00bacd91343e66b6645a0ded1.poster.avif?t=1764682048\" width=1170 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802500/extras/a95ccec00bacd91343e66b6645a0ded1.webm?t=1764682048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight in pachinko style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The more pegs you hit, the more damage you deal. Trigger special effects, explosions, extra bounces and wildly out-of-control abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802500/extras/e4836fc4da347066dc2069f9169cacb4.poster.avif?t=1764682048\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802500/extras/e4836fc4da347066dc2069f9169cacb4.webm?t=1764682048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a new map every run</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New boards, planets, bosses and third-contact encounters await in every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802500/extras/3e97603bbc66fcffa3513d09007b7574.poster.avif?t=1764682048\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802500/extras/3e97603bbc66fcffa3513d09007b7574.webm?t=1764682048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since cosmic memory began, you\u2019ve devoured entire worlds. <br> Then you found something rarer than a supernova: <strong>love</strong>. <br> Peace lasted\u2026 until a mysterious entity took your beloved away. <br> Now you travel through confused galaxies, hostile planets, sentient vegetables and collapsing realities, determined to <strong>find her.</strong> <br> And if you destroy half a galaxy along the way? <br> \u2026A <strong>side effect.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splatchinko is a blend of chaotic pachinko and turn-based roguelike. <br> Enemies are aggressive, physics gave up long ago, but you wield powerful EYES with unique abilities and absurd mutations that radically change every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802500?t=1764682048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802500/fad35821211a1082ca1b863a0e5aba8c5f76ec9c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764682048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802500/89ea066b9eb827636e362c6e1eae0cbc1b3a79f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764682048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802500/89ea066